# Register legend (from mainline wcd934x register map):
#   0601 ANA_BIAS        80 = analog bias enabled
#   0608 ANA_RX_SUPPLIES c1 = RX bias + supplies on
#   060a ANA_EAR         80 = EAR PA enable (bit7) set
#   0711 MCLK_PRG?       91 = clock config live (matches earlier probes)
#   0b41 RX0_PATH_CTL    24 = path enabled + unmuted (bit5 clear), rate field 0
#   0c0b CLSH_K2_LSB     80 = reset-default coefficient at time of probe
#
# Note for Ember: these mid-stream values were captured while audio played;
# idle readbacks show power-down zeros (0601/0608/060a=00) and are not failures.
